{
  "$comment": "AgentLens layer manifest for scripts/debt/services_layering.py. Layers are ordered bottom -> top; a component may reference its own layer or any lower one, never a higher one, and never along a dependency cycle. AgentLens/Services/<Feature>/Contracts/** is automatically the component <Feature>.Contracts on the contracts layer. Every AgentLens/Services/<Dir> must appear here. See docs/SERVICES_DECOMPOSITION_PROGRAM.md and docs/architecture/017-services-layering-and-composition-root.md.",
